WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.532
The concepts from this module directly affect rag.

00:00:03.532 --> 00:00:12.177
Context limits determine how many chunks can fit, deterministic decoding can improve repeatability for factual tasks,

00:00:12.177 --> 00:00:19.587
model capacity affects how well evidence is used, and prompt injection can arrive through retrieved text.

00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:25.872
rag changes the context, but the same generation and security principles still apply.

00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:33.787
For example, a larger context window can allow more evidence, but adding more chunks is not automatically better if the

00:00:33.787 --> 00:00:36.936
extra text is irrelevant or contradictory.
